# Good-Fortune Unicorn: "Whenever another creature you control enters, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature." Bot1's Ornithopter,
# entering after the Unicorn, gets one counter (a 1/3); the Unicorn itself gets none (it is not "another"), a Mox Ruby (no creature)
# gets none, and Bot2's Ornithopter, a creature another player controls, gets none.

